# Private Parties with Rhythm Culture

Its seems as though private parties, hens nights, weddings and birthdays are setting the scene for African Drumming at the moment! We have been inundated with bookings for drumming drumming and more drumming.....Everyone is looking for something just a little bit different for their party entertainment, some want laughs, others want skills and most importantly everyone wants FUN. We are loving this dynamic role in doing what we love....we also have a few of our own special days coming up and of course there will be drumming...lots of it! :)
